repository-code: "https://github.com/aloth/PowerSkills"
url: "https://github.com/aloth/PowerSkills"
abstract: >
  A PowerShell toolkit exposing Windows and Microsoft 365 capabilities to AI agents as
  structured JSON: mail, calendar, Teams, SharePoint and OneDrive through Work IQ and
  Microsoft Graph, plus Outlook COM, Edge browser control over CDP, desktop automation
  and shell commands. Each skill carries a SKILL.md for self-discovery.
keywords:
  - PowerShell
  - AI agents
  - Windows
  - Microsoft 365
  - Microsoft Graph
  - automation
  - agent skills
